  "notes": "USAGE: {応対|おうたい} focuses on how one responds to or deals with people, often emphasizing manner and quality of interaction.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{応対|おうたい}する (to deal with, to respond to)\n・{応対|おうたい}が{良|よ}い/{悪|わる}い (good/bad service)\n・{電話|でんわ}{応対|おうたい} (telephone reception)\n・{窓口|まどぐち}{応対|おうたい} (counter service)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{応接|おうせつ} - receiving guests (more formal, hospitality)\n・{対応|たいおう} - response, handling (broader, includes non-personal situations)\n・{接客|せっきゃく} - customer service",
